sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Chip as TournamentChip
    participant Menu as PriorityMenu<br/>(data-zoom-menu)
    participant DZ as DayDetailZoom
    participant State as priorityOverrides<br/>useState
    participant TE as activity-telemetry
    participant API as PUT /api/planned-tournaments/:id
    participant QC as queryClient
    participant Hook as useDayDetail
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>planned_tournaments

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 1: Click no badge abre menu ---

    User->>Chip: click PriorityBadge (id=abc, prioridade atual=2)
    Chip->>DZ: setOpenMenuId('priority-abc')
    DZ->>Chip: re-render com className z-40 (D5)
    DZ->>Menu: renderiza dropdown z-50 (D5)<br/>data-zoom-menu marker
    Menu-->>User: 3 opcoes (1 Alta, 2 Media, 3 Baixa)

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 2: Optimistic overlay (D3) ---

    User->>Menu: click target "1" (Alta)
    Menu->>DZ: handlePrioritySet(id='abc', newPriority=1)
    DZ->>State: setPriorityOverrides(prev => ({...prev, abc: 1}))
    State-->>DZ: { abc: 1 }
    DZ->>Chip: re-render com effectivePriority = overrides[abc] ?? item.prioridade = 1
    Chip-->>User: badge VERMELHO (Alta) — optimistic instantaneo

    DZ->>TE: safeEmit('coach.day_zoom_priority_set',<br/>{tournamentId:'abc', dayOfWeek:5, profileLetter:'A', prioridade:1})
    DZ->>API: PUT /api/planned-tournaments/abc<br/>{ prioridade: 1 }

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 3: Click-away fecha menu (D4) ---

    User->>DZ: mousedown fora do menu
    DZ->>DZ: document.mousedown handler<br/>target.closest('[data-zoom-menu]') === null
    DZ->>State: setOpenMenuId(null)
    DZ->>Menu: unmount

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 4: Server responde + refetch ---

    API->>DB: UPDATE planned_tournaments SET prioridade=1<br/>WHERE id='abc' RETURNING *
    DB-->>API: row { id:'abc', prioridade:1, ... }
    API-->>DZ: 200 OK
    DZ->>QC: queryClient.invalidateQueries(['day-detail', 'A', 5])
    QC->>Hook: re-fetch
    Hook->>API: GET /api/grade/day-detail/A/5
    API->>DB: SELECT pt.prioridade, pt.registration_time, ... (D2 + 6f0396bc)
    DB-->>API: list [{id:'abc', prioridade:1, ...}, ...]
    API-->>Hook: 200 { list: [...], volume: [...] }
    Hook-->>DZ: data atualizado

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 5: Cleanup overlay quando server confirma (D3 short-circuit) ---

    DZ->>DZ: useEffect dispara com deps [data?.list]
    DZ->>State: setPriorityOverrides(prev => ...)
    State->>State: for item in data.list:<br/>if item.id in prev && data.list[i].prioridade === prev[item.id]:<br/>delete next[item.id]
    State->>State: changed=true → return next<br/>(short-circuit se changed=false — evita re-render — RF-SMELL-03 fix)
    State-->>DZ: {} (overlay limpo)
    DZ->>Chip: re-render com effectivePriority = item.prioridade = 1 (do server)
    Chip-->>User: badge VERMELHO (Alta) — sem flash (mesmo valor)

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 6: Error path (PUT 4xx) ---

    rect rgba(255,200,200,0.2)
        Note over API,DZ: Se API retorna 4xx (validation, network, etc):
        API-->>DZ: 400 { message: 'invalid priority' }
        DZ->>State: setPriorityOverrides(prev => omit(prev, 'abc')) ROLLBACK
        DZ->>Chip: re-render com item.prioridade = 2 (valor original)
        DZ->>TE: toast erro
    end

    Note over User,DB: --- Fase 7: Reabrir modal (RF-FIX-01 — prioridade persiste) ---

    User->>DZ: fecha modal (Esc)
    User->>DZ: reabre (click Detalhes do mesmo dia)
    DZ->>Hook: useDayDetail re-mount
    Hook->>API: GET /api/grade/day-detail/A/5
    API->>DB: SELECT pt.prioridade (D2 — agora vem no payload)
    DB-->>API: { prioridade: 1, ... }
    API-->>Hook: 200
    Hook-->>DZ: data.list[i].prioridade = 1
    DZ->>Chip: render badge VERMELHO (persistido — bug fix 6f0396bc validado por TDD)
    Chip-->>User: prioridade preservada cross-reopen
